# ─── Environment / credentials (DO NOT COMMIT) ───────────────────────
# Local secrets live in `.env` files (gitignored). For team-shared
# variables, use `.env.example` placeholders + your platform's secret
# manager (Railway Variables, Vercel Project Settings, GitHub Secrets,
# 1Password CLI, etc.).
.env
.env.*
*.env
backend/.env
frontend/.env

# Test-only credential docs may leak prod keys — keep them out of git.
memory/test_credentials.md

# Other credential artefacts
credentials.json
*token.json*
*credentials.json*